            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Model:</strong> 6040 (7BE)<br/><br/><strong>Machine Type:</strong> Semi-Automatic Double Station Hydraulic Heat Press<br/><br/><strong>Pressure:</strong> Up to 30 kg/cm²<br/><br/><strong>Temperature Range:</strong> 0–399°C (32–750°F)<br/><br/><strong>Time Range:</strong> 0–999 seconds<br/><br/><strong>Available Platen Sizes:</strong> 40 × 40 cm, 40 × 50 cm, 40 × 60 cm, 50 × 70 cm, 60 × 80 cm<br/><br/><strong>Voltage Options:</strong> 220V Single Phase / 220V Three Phase / 380V Three Phase<br/><br/><strong>Power:</strong> 4.0–6.8 kW depending on platen size<br/><br/><strong>Operation:</strong> Hydraulic<br/><br/><strong>Stations:</strong> Dual Station<br/><br/><strong>Air Compressor:</strong> Not Required<br/><br/></p>",
