            "heading": "2 — Key Features",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Dual-Station Workflow</strong><br/><br/>Prepare and position the next garment while the other station is pressing, helping reduce downtime and increase production efficiency.</p><p><strong>Powerful Hydraulic Pressure</strong><br/><br/>Delivers up to 30 kg/cm² of stable pressure for consistent heat-transfer results.</p><p><strong>No Air Compressor Required</strong><br/><br/>The integrated hydraulic system eliminates the need for an external air compressor, simplifying installation and operation.</p><p><strong>Digital Time & Temperature Control</strong><br/><br/>Easily adjust pressing temperature and time for repeatable production.</p><p><strong>Heavy-Duty Construction</strong><br/><br/>Designed for professional DTF shops, apparel decorators, print shops, and commercial production environments.</p><p><strong>Emergency Stop Protection</strong><br/><br/>Convenient emergency-stop controls provide additional protection during daily operation.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CVPTEf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3 — Applications",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Designed for professional heat-transfer and apparel-decoration applications.</p><p><strong>Recommended for:</strong></p><p>• DTF Transfers<br/><br/>• T-Shirts<br/><br/>• Hoodies & Sweatshirts<br/><br/>• Tote Bags<br/><br/>• Workwear<br/><br/>• Sportswear<br/><br/>• Promotional Apparel<br/><br/>• Compatible Heat Transfer Applications</p><p>The dual-station design is especially suitable for businesses that need higher production efficiency than a standard single-station heat press.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
