            "heading": "4 — Shipping & Ordering",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Important:</strong> This is a commercial industrial machine. Shipping methods and costs may vary depending on machine configuration and delivery location.</p><p><strong>Before placing your order, please confirm:</strong></p><p>• Platen size<br/><br/>• Required voltage and phase<br/><br/>• Delivery address<br/><br/>• Commercial or residential delivery location<br/><br/>• Any special delivery requirements</p><p>Due to the size and weight of the machine, freight delivery may be required.</p><p>If you're unsure which configuration is right for your business, please contact DESCECI before ordering. Our team can help you select the appropriate platen size and electrical configuration.</p>",
            "page": ""
